&Q000674 = A hymn to Nanna (Nanna E)
@composite
#project: etcslatf/inter
#atf: use unicode
#atf: use math
#etcsl: text-id=c.4.13.05
#key: after http://etcsl.orinst.ox.ac.uk/cgi-bin/etcsl.cgi?text=c.4.13.05&display=Crit&charenc=gcirc#

1. dumu nun-e |AB×A| kug-ta e₃#-a ba-zal-zal si i₃-[...]
#tr.en: Princely son, you are radiant as you come forth from the sacred bathing chamber (?), …….
#lem: dumu[child]; nun[prince]; AB×A[bathing chamber]; kug[pure]; e[leave]; zal[pass time]; si[horn]; X
#etcsl: line-id=1

2. kur me sikil eš₃ abzu šag₄ X X daŋal kur me# [...]
#tr.en: …… the mountain of pure divine powers, the @fsux{abzu} shrine, …….
#lem: kur[mountain(s)]; me[Being]; sikil[purify]; eš[shrine]; Eʾabzu[1]; šag[heart]; X; X; daŋal[wide]; kur[mountain(s)]; me[Being]; X
#etcsl: line-id=2

3. ki-ur₃ mah dur₂# [X X] daŋal#-la [...]
#tr.en: …… the majestic foundation platform, …….
#lem: kiʾur[foundation]; mah[great]; dur[buttocks]; X; X; daŋal[wide]; X
#etcsl: line-id=3

4. ambar-ta me-lem₄# huš# tum₃# muš₃# ni₂# [X X]-ge-en
#tr.en: Bringing terrifying radiance from the marshes, you …… a fearsome …….
#lem: ambar[reed-bed]; melim[frightening splendor]; huš[reddish]; tum[bring]; muš[face]; ni[fear]; X; X
#etcsl: line-id=4

5. nam-dug₃-zu-še₃ nam-gal nam-mah-zu-še₃ saŋ im-ma#-il₂-la₂
#tr.en: Lifting your head in your goodness, greatness and majesty, majestically you extend your arm in order to determine destinies:
#lem: namdug[goodness]; namgal[greatness]; nammah[greatness]; saŋ[head]; il[raise]
#etcsl: line-id=5

6. nam tar-re-de₃-eš a₂ mah mi-ni-in-sud₄-un
#tr.en: great @wDN{An} has liberally bestowed on you your kingship over heaven and earth,
#lem: nam[fate]; tar[cut]; a[arm]; mah[great]; sud[distant]
#etcsl: line-id=6

7. nam-lugal an ki-zu an gal-e šu daŋal mu-ri-in-dug₄
#tr.en: and @wDN{Enlil} has perfected for you your great and noble filial status and lordship.
#lem: namlugal[kingship]; an[sky]; ki[place]; An[1]DN; gal[big]; šu[hand]; daŋal[wide]; dug[speak]
#etcsl: line-id=7

8. nam-dumu nun gal-zu {d}en-lil₂-le nam-men! šu mi-ri-in-du₇
#tr.en: @wDN{Enlil} has made majestic divinity manifest for you. Determining a destiny for your flowing waters,
#lem: namdumu[status as son]; nun[prince]; gal[big]; Enlil[1]DN; nammen[lordship]; šu[hand]; du[perfect]
#etcsl: line-id=8

9. nam-diŋir mah {d}en-lil₂ pa e₃ ma-ra-ni-in-e₃
#tr.en: the majestic lower (?) waters,
#lem: namdiŋir[divinity]; mah[great]; Enlil[1]DN; pa[branch]; e[leave]; e[leave]
#etcsl: line-id=9

10. a DU-a a sig mah-zu-še₃ nam tar-re ki dug₃ ama dug₃
#tr.en: @wDN{Enki} from within the sacred bathing chamber (?) has placed the good earth,
#lem: a[water]; X; a[water]; sig[weak]; mah[great]; nam[fate]; tar[cut]; ki[place]; dug[good]; ama[mother]; dug[good]
#etcsl: line-id=10

11. {d}en-ki |AB×A|-šag₄ kug-ta ŋiri₃-zu-še₃ im-mi-in-ŋar
#tr.en: the good mother, at your feet.
#lem: Enkik[1]DN; AB×A.šag₄[center of a bathing chamber]; kug[pure]; ŋiri[foot]; ŋar[put]
#etcsl: line-id=11

12. {d}en-lil₂ nam-mah nam-en-na mi-ni-in-tud-de₃-en
#tr.en: @wDN{Enlil} has sired you in majesty and lordship.
#lem: Enlil[1]DN; nammah[greatness]; namen[the office of en-priest]; utud[give birth (to)]
#etcsl: line-id=12

13. {d}nanna ud-sakar-zu ud-sakar 7-bi mu pad₃-da
#tr.en: O @wDN{Nanna}, your crescent moon is called "the crescent moon of the seventh day (?)".
#lem: Nanna[1]DN; udsakar[crescent moon]; udsakar[crescent moon]; n; mu[name]; pad[find]
#etcsl: line-id=13

14. {d}en-lil₂ an ki-ka mu-zu mu kug-ga mu mi-ri-in-pad₃
#tr.en: @wDN{Enlil} has made known throughout heaven and earth your name, which is a sacred name.
#lem: Enlil[1]DN; an[sky]; ki[place]; mu[name]; mu[name]; kug[pure]; mu[name]; pad[find]
#etcsl: line-id=14

15. dumu nun-e nam-gal-zu an ki-a pa e₃ im-mi-in-e₃
#tr.en: Princely son, he has made your greatness manifest throughout heaven and earth. The majestic assembly has bestowed on you his status as @wDN{Enlil}.
#lem: dumu[child]; nun[prince]; namgal[greatness]; an[sky]; ki[place]; pa[branch]; e[leave]; e[leave]
#etcsl: line-id=15

16. unken mah nam {d}en-lil₂-la₂-na saŋ-e-eš mu-ra-an-rig₇
#tr.en: And from the place of the sanctuary @wSN{Eridug}, @wDN{Enki} has determined for you your lordship and majesty.
#lem: unkin[assembly]; mah[great]; nam[fate]; Enlil[1]DN; saŋ[head]; rig[donate]
#etcsl: line-id=16

17. {d}en-ki-ke₄ ki eš₃ eridug{ki}-ta nam-men! nam-mah-zu mu-ri-in-tar
#tr.en: King of heaven and earth who adorns heaven and earth (?), from the majestic @fsux{abzu},
#lem: Enkik[1]DN; ki[place]; eš[shrine]; Eridug[1]SN; nammen[lordship]; nammah[greatness]; tar[cut]
#etcsl: line-id=17

18. abzu mah ki eš₃ eridug{ki}-ta nam-en gal-zu-še₃
#tr.en: the place of the sanctuary @wSN{Eridug},
#lem: abzu[(cosmic) underground water]; mah[great]; ki[place]; eš[shrine]; Eridug[1]SN; namen[the office of en-priest]; gal[big]
#etcsl: line-id=18

19. lugal an ki-ke₄ an# ki# gun₃-a nam-gal-zu-še₃ ba-an-dug₄
#tr.en: he has declared your great lordship and your greatness.
#lem: lugal[king]; an[sky]; ki[place]; an[sky]; ki[place]; gunu[speckled]; namgal[greatness]; dug[speak]
#etcsl: line-id=19

20. {d}nanna saŋ-zu il₂ {d}a-nun-na-ke₄-ne-er ha-la ba-an-pad₃
#tr.en: O @wDN{Nanna}, he has chosen as your inheritance that you should surpass the @wDN{Anuna} gods.
#lem: Nanna[1]DN; saŋ[head]; il[raise]; Anunak[1]DN; hala[inheritance share]; pad[find]
#etcsl: line-id=20

21. me sikil šag₄ hul₂-la-ka-ne-ne ki#-tuš kug# im-mi-ni-in-tuš-un
#tr.en: He has seated you in a sacred dwelling amid their pure divine powers which gladden the heart.
#lem: me[Being]; sikil[purify]; šag[heart]; hul[rejoice]; kituš[dwelling place]; kug[purify]; tuš[sit (down)]
#etcsl: line-id=21

22. diŋir gal-gal-e-ne nidba-eš gal# [ba]-an-pad₃
#tr.en: He has grandly called the great gods to the food offerings.
#lem: diŋir[deity]; gal[big]; nindaba[(food) offering]; gal[big]; pad[find]
#etcsl: line-id=22

23. zag gu-la₂ šag₄ hi-li mah si-a im#-[mi-ni]-in-durun-uš
#tr.en: He has seated them for the ritual which fills the heart with majestic pleasure.
#lem: zag[side]; gal[big]; šag[heart]; hili[attractiveness]; mah[great]; si[fill]; durun[sit]
#etcsl: line-id=23

24. diŋir-re-e-ne sizkur₂ šag₄ hul₂-la-ne#-[ne im]-mi#-ni-in-šum₂-šum₂
#tr.en: He has presented to (?) the gods their offerings which gladden the heart.
#lem: diŋir[deity]; siškur[prayer]; šag[heart]; hul[rejoice]; šum[give]
#etcsl: line-id=24

25. ki mah ki kug-ga mi-ni-in#-[tuš]-un
#tr.en: He has seated you in a majestic place, a sacred place.
#lem: ki[place]; mah[great]; ki[place]; kug[pure]; tuš[sit (down)]
#etcsl: line-id=25

26. {d}nanna ki kug-ga ki-tuš kug mi-ni-in-[tuš]-un#
#tr.en: O @wDN{Nanna}, he has seated you in a sacred place, a sacred dwelling.
#lem: Nanna[1]DN; ki[place]; kug[pure]; kituš[dwelling place]; kug[purify]; tuš[sit (down)]
#etcsl: line-id=26

27. {d}en-ki-ke₄ ki-tuš ma-ra-ab-sikil-e# ki#-tuš# ma#-ra#-ab-šen-e
